{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45613","headline":"怀张爲周朴 · 贯休","name":"怀张爲周朴","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"张周二夫子，诗好人太癖。\n更不过岭来，如今头尽白。\n人传禹力不到处，河声流向西。\n又到处即闭户，逢君方展眉。\n不知是不是，若是即大奇。\n我又闻二公，心与人不同。\n一生常在寂寞中，有时狂吟入僧宅。\n锦囊鸟啼荔枝红，有时冥搜海山脑。\n珊瑚枝动日杲杲，圣君在上知不知，赤面浊醪许多好。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贯休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45613.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45613","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}